.github/workflows/*, ip_access.example.yml, build.bat, run.bat) were also
modified or added.

Modifications include, but are not limited to:

    - Added a terminal UI console (ratatui) for server administration.
    - Added an IP allow/deny list with glob and CIDR matching.
    - Added per-IP traffic limiting with configurable exceed actions.
    - Added a temporary maintenance/close mode.
    - Added IPv4 / IPv6 / both listen address selection.
    - Added per-stream sent/received byte counters.
    - Reworked logging to write to both a rolling file and an in-TUI buffer.
    - Hardened the connection handshake (no global lock held during it, plus a
      handshake timeout) and the uleb128 decoder.

